Slow, relentless, and heavily armored, the **Spider Tank** exists
for one thing: destruction. Bristling with weapons, it has no
trouble carrying out its programming.

**Attributes:** Armored +3, Attack +3 (Countless Weapons), Combat Expert +2, Tough +1; Awkward Size −3 (Huge), Clumsy −1, Emotionless −3, Slow −1, Vulnerability −2 (Electricity).

